msgid "Back to ship upgrade category explanation list"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5413
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid "missiles"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5414
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid ""
"Missile upgrades refer to aspects of the missile weapons systems. They might "
"include additional tubes, faster tube load times, increased tube size, "
"additional missile types or additional missile storage capacity."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5418
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid "shield"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5419
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid ""
"Shield upgrades refer to the protective energy shields around your ship. "
"They might include increased charge capacity (overall strength) for the "
"front, rear or both shield arcs or the addition of a shield arc."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5423
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid "hull"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5424
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid ""
"Hull upgrades refer to strengthening the ship hull to withstand more damage "
"in the form of armor plating or structural bolstering."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5428
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid "impulse"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5429
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid ""
"Impulse upgrades refer to changes related to the impulse engines. They might "
"include improving the top speed or acceleration (forward, reverse or both), "
"maneuvering speed or combat maneuver (boost, which is moving forward, or "
"strafe, which is sideways motion or both)."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5433
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid "ftl"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5434
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid ""
"FTL (short for faster than light) upgrades refer to warp drive or jump drive "
"enhancements. They might include the addition of an ftl drive, a change in "
"the range of the jump drive or an increase in the top speed of the warp drive"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5438
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid "sensors"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5439
msgctxt "upgrade-comms"
msgid ""
"Sensor upgrades refer to the ship's ability to detect other objects. They "
"might include increased long range sensors, increased short range sensors, "
"automated proximity scanners for ships or improved range for automated "
"proximity scanners."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5447
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Is there any chance at victory for this outpost?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5448
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"The outpost leadership have been bemoaning their fate and discussing various "
"options. They think there's an off chance for long term viability for the "
"outpost."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5449
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Don't keep me in suspense"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5450
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"It's a low probability scenario, but if we destroyed the most aggressive "
"enemy stations in the area, we might get the rest to agree to a truce."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5451
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Which ones are the aggressive ones?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5453
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"The ones that keep sending attacking ships. You can just track back along "
"the attacking ships' approach vector to find their home base."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5454
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Have you tracked any based on approach vector?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5462
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"From our observations, %s station %s in %s is one of them.\n"
"\n"
"One more thing about this plan..."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5463
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Just one? What is it?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5464
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"If there are any friendly or neutral stations you haven't contacted yet to "
"ask for their help, you should contact them at your earliest opportunity. A "
"truce benefits them, too, assuming you succeed. The help they provide in "
"protecting the outpost can free you up to destroy the aggressive stations."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5471
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "%s station %s in %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5480
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "%s station %s in %s is probably another aggressive station"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5490
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Any better chance at victory for this outpost?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5493
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"%s station %s in %s is still the one station we've been able to track the "
"attacking ships back to."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5502
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "%s station %s in %s is probably another aggressive station."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5506
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Remind me about the saboteur plan"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5507
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Summary: Be sure you have at least one mine aboard. Find a neutral "
"freighter. Convince them to take on a new crewmember. From there it's up to "
"the saboteur."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5509
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
"You have already planted the saboteur on %s"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5512
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
"You need to replace one or more of your repair crew. We'll be sure the first "
"one you get also has saboteur training."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5515
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"%s\n"
"You need a mine to give to the saboteur."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5523
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"%s The outpost leadership have an idea about how an aggressive enemy station "
"might be destroyed. It differs from the confrontational solution of "
"attacking an aggressive enemy station directly. Interested?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5524
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Yes, tell me about this idea"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5525
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "The idea is to sneak a saboteur aboard an aggressive enemy station."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5526
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "We can't dock with an enemy station"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5527
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"That's true. However, commercial freighters dock with those stations all the "
"time. Commerce must go on despite the hostilities."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5528
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Put a saboteur on a freighter?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5529
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Right. The saboteur stays on the freighter until the freighter docks with an "
"aggressive enemy station. The saboteur then plants explosives on the station "
"at a vulnerable point."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5530
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "I see problems with this idea"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5531
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Oh yes, there are several critical points where the plan could fail. The "
"freighter you choose might not accept the saboteur. The freighter might get "
"destroyed before they dock at an aggressive enemy station. The security "
"measures on the station may prevent the saboteur from planting the "
"explosives."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5532
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Another point: we don't have a saboteur"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5533
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Actually, that's not true. One of your repair crew recently completed a "
"correspondence course in espionage and sabotage and thus could be deployed "
"as the saboteur for this plan."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5534
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Does graduation come with complimentary explosives?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5535
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"No. We did away with an actual graduation ceremony because too many of our "
"graduates wanted to test their new sabotage skills as a prank at graduation "
"causing distressful mayhem. However, your repair crew now has the training "
"to adapt one of your mines into the appropriate explosives for the plan."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5536
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Isn't it illegal?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5537
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Your repair crew saboteur has the full backing and approval of the outpost "
"leadership. The sabotage is sanctioned under the rules outlined in the %s "
"charter assuming the saboteur knows the risks and volunteers. We've taken "
"the liberty of providing an outline of the plan to the repair crew saboteur "
"and secured their agreement to conduct the mission in writing. Copies of "
"this and the formal sanctioning of the action by the outpost leadership are "
"in your secure databanks."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5538
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "How do we know if this plan succeeds or fails?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5539
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Every saboteur is trained to send simple status reports through the "
"microscopic subspace transmitter surgically implanted in them during their "
"training. When you check on your orders, updates will be shown on the plan "
"progress in that report."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5540
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "That's a convoluted plan. Can you summarize what we need to do?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5541
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"Be sure you have at least one mine aboard. Find a neutral freighter. "
"Convince them to take on a new crewmember. From there it's up to the "
"saboteur."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5561
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "No, we're having enough trouble as it is"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5562
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Suit yourself"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_44_outpost.lua:5619
msgctxt "ship-comms"
msgid "Would you like another crewmember?"
